commit fd537bc696d65ce3baec88ecf5a825f7eaaaf484
Author: John Spray <jspray@redhat.com>
Date:   Sat Jul 16 22:04:39 2016 +0100

    mgr: enable active daemon to return to standby
    
    Rather than respawn a whole process, just fall back
    to being a standby.
    
    Signed-off-by: John Spray <john.spray@redhat.com>

